(26, '289 Charoen Nakhon Road, Khlong San District, Bangkok 10600, Thailand', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the perfect blend of modern luxury and Thai hospitality at our stunning riverside hotel in the heart of Bangkok. Our elegantly appointed rooms offer sweeping views of the Chao Phraya River, world-class amenities, and personalized service. Discover the vibrant energy of Bangkok while enjoying a peaceful sanctuary just steps away from temples, markets, and bustling nightlife.', 'A valid government-issued ID is required at check-in, and guests must provide a credit card for security deposit (refundable upon checkout). Quiet hours are observed from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM to ensure all guests enjoy a restful stay.', 13.708884, 100.498175, 21, 'Riverside Serenity Bangkok - Luxury Riverside Retreat', false, 5, 1, 35),
(27, 'Sueyoshicho 27, Higashiyama Ward, Gion', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Step into the enchantment of Kyoto''s most storied neighborhood with this beautifully restored traditional villa in the heart of Gion. Featuring authentic wooden architecture, private gardens, and modern amenities, your stay offers the perfect blend of historic charm and contemporary comfort. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere where geisha have walked for centuries, with exclusive access to the district''s restaurants, tea houses, and cultural treasures.', 'A refundable deposit of ¥50,000 is required upon arrival, and guests must observe quiet hours from 10 PM to 8 AM to respect the neighborhood''s cultural integrity. Valid photo ID is required for all guests at check-in.', 35.004991, 135.773871, 21, 'Geisha District Sanctuary Villa', true, 2, 3, 21),
(28, 'Higashiyama Ward, 1-chome, Ishibashicho 42, Kyoto, Kyoto, Japan', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience authentic Kyoto living in our beautifully restored traditional machiya hostel, perfectly positioned between the Gion district and Higashiyama temples. Wake up to stunning views of pagodas and bamboo groves while connecting with fellow travelers in our cozy communal spaces. Immerse yourself in the heart of Japan''s ancient capital at unbeatable prices.', 'All guests must present a valid passport or ID upon check-in. A refundable ¥5,000 damage deposit is required, with quiet hours enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM—please respect fellow guests'' rest time.', 35.006753, 135.777722, 21, 'Geisha''s Haven Hostel', false, 3, 5, 20),
(29, 'Hanami-cho 247, Higashiyama-ku, Kyoto', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience the timeless charm of Kyoto in our meticulously restored traditional machiya townhouse nestled in the heart of Gion''s atmospheric geisha district. Each room is thoughtfully appointed with authentic period furnishings, modern amenities, and serene garden views that transport you to old Japan. Wake to the sound of stone lanterns and the essence of samurai-era elegance.', 'A refundable deposit of ¥20,000 is required at check-in; quiet hours are observed from 9 PM to 8 AM to maintain the peaceful atmosphere. Valid government-issued identification is required for all guests at check-in.', 34.992610, 135.774863, 18, 'Machiya Elegance Gion', false, 5, 8, 21),
(30, '47/8 Sukhumvit Road, Soi 38, Prakanong, Wattana, Bangkok 10110', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Escape the hustle and bustle of Bangkok in our charming garden cottage nestled along the vibrant Sukhumvit Road. This intimate hideaway features traditional Thai-inspired décor, a private courtyard oasis, and easy access to world-class dining, shopping, and nightlife. Experience authentic Bangkok hospitality in a peaceful setting just minutes from the BTS Skytrain.', 'A refundable security deposit of 3,000 THB is required at check-in. Guests must provide a valid ID and respect quiet hours between 22:00-08:00. Smoking is strictly prohibited inside the cottage.', 13.723624, 100.579291, 18, 'Sukhumvit Garden Cottage - Boutique Retreat in Bangkok', true, 4, 7, 36),
(31, '42 Macleay Street, Potts Point, Sydney', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Escape to this charming heritage cottage nestled in the heart of Sydney, offering an intimate retreat with stunning views of Sydney Harbour and easy access to iconic landmarks. Beautifully restored with modern amenities, original hardwood floors, and a sun-drenched garden terrace, this property is perfect for couples and small families seeking authentic Sydney charm. Wake up to the sound of native birds and spend your evenings sipping wine with the city lights twinkling across the water.', 'A $300 AUD security deposit is required at check-in, and quiet hours are observed between 10 PM and 8 AM to respect neighbouring residences. Valid government-issued ID is required for all guests upon arrival.', -33.870638, 151.225597, 21, 'Cosy Harbour View Cottage', false, 3, 7, 39),
(32, 'Sukhumvit Road 38, Sukhumvit, Bangkok, Thailand', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience ultimate tropical luxury along Bangkok''s most vibrant boulevard at Sukhumvit Serenity Resort & Spa. Our elegantly designed suites feature private balconies overlooking lush gardens, world-class dining, and a full-service spa offering traditional Thai treatments. Discover the perfect blend of urban convenience and serene sanctuary, just steps from premier shopping, dining, and nightlife.', 'A refundable deposit of 1,000 THB is required upon check-in, and quiet hours are observed from 10 PM to 8 AM. All guests must present a valid passport or government-issued ID at the reception desk during the registration process.', 13.724139, 100.572581, 18, 'Sukhumvit Serenity Resort & Spa', true, 4, 4, 36),
(33, 'Nanzenjimachi 3-chōme 156, Kyoto', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', false, true, 'Step into authentic Japanese elegance at our charming traditional cottage nestled in the heart of Kyoto''s peaceful Higashiyama district. This beautifully restored machiya blends centuries-old architectural charm with modern comfort, offering guests an immersive experience in Japan''s cultural capital. Wake up to serene garden views and explore centuries-old temples just moments away from your private sanctuary.', 'A refundable deposit of ¥30,000 is required upon booking and will be returned after checkout. Quiet hours are observed from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM, and a valid government-issued ID must be presented at check-in.', 34.961631, 135.671022, 21, 'Sakura Dream Cottage - Historic Kyoto Retreat', false, 5, 7, 20),
(34, '2-5-1 Yotsuya, Shinjuku-ku, Tokyo', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience the perfect blend of traditional Japanese hospitality and contemporary luxury in the heart of Tokyo''s vibrant Shinjuku district. Our stylish resort features modern amenities, rooftop dining with city views, and easy access to shopping, entertainment, and transportation hubs. Discover tranquility amidst the electric energy of Tokyo.', 'A valid government-issued ID is required at check-in, and a refundable deposit of ¥10,000 is held for incidental charges. Quiet hours are observed from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM in all guest rooms and common areas.', 35.686739, 139.726469, 18, 'Shinjuku Zen Retreat - Modern Luxury Resort', false, 3, 4, 17),
(35, '247 Lafayette Street', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Discover timeless elegance in the heart of Manhattan at The Velvet Sanctuary, an intimate 45-room boutique hotel where art deco charm meets contemporary comfort. Nestled between iconic skyscrapers, our property offers personalized service, curated local artwork, and access to the city''s finest dining and cultural attractions. Experience New York luxury redefined through our bespoke concierge, elevated rooftop bar, and impeccably appointed suites designed for the discerning traveler.', 'A valid government-issued ID is required at check-in, and we require a one-night deposit to secure your reservation. Quiet hours are observed from 10 PM to 8 AM; please keep noise to a minimum during these times.', 40.722868, -73.996619, 21, 'The Velvet Sanctuary', false, 4, 8, 3),
(36, '2847 Biscayne Avenue, Miami, FL 33137', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Wake up to stunning ocean views and year-round sunshine in this elegant Miami villa featuring a private infinity pool, lush gardens, and direct beach access. This luxurious retreat offers the perfect blend of modern amenities and tropical charm, ideal for families, groups, or couples seeking an unforgettable South Florida getaway. Experience the vibrant Miami lifestyle with easy access to world-class dining, shopping, and entertainment.', 'A fully refundable security deposit of $1,500 is required at booking, and a valid government-issued ID is required from all guests upon check-in. Quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM to ensure a peaceful environment for all guests.', 25.803875, -80.189054, 21, 'Tropical Paradise Villa - Oceanview Luxury Escape', false, 5, 3, 7),
(37, 'Calle dei Fabbri, 42', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Wake up to the romance of Venice at Ponte dei Sogni, where you''ll find affordable comfort steps away from the Grand Canal and St. Mark''s Basilica. Our vibrant social atmosphere makes it easy to meet fellow travelers while exploring charming cobblestone streets and hidden canals. Experience authentic Venetian hospitality without breaking the bank.', 'A valid photo ID is required at check-in, and a €50 refundable deposit must be paid to cover potential damages and room keys. Please note that quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM in all dormitories and shared areas.', 45.435275, 12.336799, 18, 'Ponte dei Sogni Hostel', false, 4, 5, 27),
(38, '2-15-10 Shinjuku, Shinjuku Ward, Tokyo', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the vibrant pulse of Tokyo''s bustling Shinjuku district from our centrally-located hostel, where modern comfort meets the electric energy of Japan''s most iconic neighborhood. Perfect for backpackers and solo travelers, we offer clean private and dormitory rooms, a lively communal lounge, and easy access to restaurants, shops, and entertainment venues. Wake up to the glow of neon signs and fall asleep to the soundtrack of the city that never sleeps.', 'A valid photo ID and a ¥5,000 security deposit (refundable) are required at check-in. Please note that quiet hours are from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM in dormitory areas to ensure all guests enjoy a restful stay.', 35.690985, 139.708915, 21, 'Neon Nights Shinjuku Hostel', true, 3, 5, 17),
(39, 'Calle del Dose, 1847', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Wake up to the enchanting views of Venice''s iconic canals from this charming apartment nestled in the heart of the city. This beautifully restored property combines authentic Venetian character with modern comfort, offering the perfect base for exploring the narrow streets, historic squares, and world-class museums of this unique island city. Experience la dolce vita with easy access to St. Mark''s Basilica, the Rialto Bridge, and countless galleries, galleries, and trattorias.', 'A refundable security deposit of €200 is required at check-in. Guests must respect quiet hours between 10 PM and 8 AM, and valid government-issued ID is required upon arrival for registration purposes.', 45.434647, 12.346404, 18, 'Venetian Dream Canal View Apartment', false, 4, 2, 27),
(40, 'Passeig de Sant Joan 45, Barcelona 08010, Spain', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', false, true, 'Welcome to our charming guesthouse nestled in the heart of Barcelona''s vibrant Eixample district, just steps away from iconic Modernist architecture and bustling local tapas bars. This carefully curated retreat offers the perfect blend of authentic Catalan hospitality, contemporary comfort, and artistic flair that captures the spirit of the city. Whether you''re exploring the Gothic Quarter or catching sunset views from nearby rooftops, Casa Gaudí''s Dream is your ideal home base for an unforgettable Barcelona adventure.', 'A refundable security deposit of €100 is required upon arrival and will be returned after checkout. Guests must respect quiet hours from 10 PM to 8 AM, and a valid government-issued ID is required for all check-ins.', 41.396156, 2.173245, 21, 'Casa Gaudí''s Dream - Eixample Boutique Guesthouse', false, 5, 6, 31),
(41, '42 Bondi Road, Bondi NSW 2026', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Wake up to the sound of crashing waves at our vibrant beachfront hostel, just steps away from Bondi''s iconic golden sands and thriving coastal culture. Perfect for solo travelers and groups alike, we offer clean, affordable dorms and private rooms with modern facilities, free breakfast, and a social atmosphere that''ll have you making friends from around the world. Experience the ultimate Bondi beach lifestyle without breaking the bank!', 'A valid photo ID and AUD $100 security deposit (refundable) are required at check-in. Please note our quiet hours are 10 PM - 8 AM in shared dorms to ensure all guests enjoy a restful stay.', -33.892487, 151.255612, 18, 'Bondi Waves Backpackers - Beachside Comfort Hostel', false, 5, 5, 40),
(42, 'Calle Larga San Marco, 2847', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Immerse yourself in authentic Venetian luxury at this stunning waterfront villa located in the heart of San Marco, where opulent Renaissance architecture meets modern comfort. Wake up to breathtaking views of the Grand Canal and St. Mark''s Basilica, while enjoying direct access to Venice''s most iconic landmarks and charming hidden piazzas. This meticulously restored palazzo offers the perfect blend of historical elegance and contemporary amenities for an unforgettable Italian escape.', 'A refundable security deposit of €500 is required at check-in. Please note that quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM. Valid government-issued ID is required for all guests upon arrival, and entry is strictly from 3 PM on check-in day.', 45.435202, 12.339480, 18, 'Palazzo San Marco Serenity - Venetian Waterfront Villa', true, 4, 3, 28),
(43, 'Passeig de la Barceloneta, 42', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the perfect blend of Catalan culture and beachside luxury at our award-winning resort nestled in the heart of Barcelona. Wake up to stunning views of the Mediterranean Sea, indulge in world-class amenities, and explore iconic landmarks like the Sagrada Familia and Park Güell within walking distance. Your unforgettable Barcelona escape awaits with our signature spa, fine dining restaurants, and vibrant rooftop bar.', 'A 30% deposit is required to secure your booking, with the balance due 14 days before arrival. Please note that quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM, and a valid government-issued ID is required at check-in.', 41.388041, 2.170273, 18, 'Mediterranean Bliss Resort Barcelona', false, 4, 4, 31),
(44, '42 Rue de Turenne, Le Marais, Paris', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Discover Parisian elegance in the heart of Le Marais, where historic charm meets contemporary luxury in this intimate boutique resort. Wake up to the neighborhood''s vibrant energy, with world-class galleries, charming cafés, and the iconic Place des Vosges just steps away. Immerse yourself in authentic Parisian culture while enjoying personalized service and refined accommodations in one of the city''s most coveted districts.', 'A valid government-issued ID and credit card are required at check-in; a 25% non-refundable deposit secures your booking. Quiet hours are observed from 10 PM to 8 AM daily to ensure the comfort of all guests.', 48.857742, 2.364735, 18, 'Le Marais Luxe Boutique Resort', true, 5, 4, 12),
(45, 'Calle Vallaresso 1332, San Marco, Venice', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', false, false, 'Discover timeless elegance in the heart of San Marco, where Renaissance charm meets contemporary comfort. This intimate boutique hotel offers personalized service and exquisitely appointed rooms with views of Venice''s iconic canals and basilicas. Immerse yourself in Venetian culture while enjoying modern amenities and the warmth of true Adriatic hospitality.', 'A 20% deposit is required at booking, with the balance due upon arrival. Please note that quiet hours are enforced between 22:00-08:00, and a valid passport or ID is mandatory for all guests at check-in.', 45.432691, 12.337037, 18, 'Palazzo Veneziano Boutique', false, 2, 8, 28),
(46, '1250 Ocean Drive, Miami, FL 33139', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', false, true, 'Experience the ultimate Miami getaway at our beachfront oasis, featuring stunning ocean views, world-class dining, and rejuvenating spa treatments. Our elegant rooms blend tropical elegance with modern amenities, while direct access to Miami''s finest white-sand beach ensures unforgettable sunsets. From vibrant nightlife to serene relaxation, Sunset Palms captures the essence of Miami living at its finest.', 'A valid government-issued ID is required at check-in, and a refundable security deposit of $150 is collected upon arrival. Quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM; guests requesting early check-in or late checkout may incur additional fees based on availability.', 25.783759, -80.130242, 18, 'Sunset Palms Miami Luxury Resort & Spa', true, 5, 1, 7),
(47, '1-12-8 Shibuya, Shibuya Ward, Tokyo', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience the pulse of Tokyo''s vibrant Shibuya district from our intimate 24-room boutique hotel, where minimalist Japanese design meets contemporary luxury. Each thoughtfully curated suite features floor-to-ceiling windows, premium bedding, and curated local artwork that celebrates Tokyo''s creative spirit. Indulge in our signature onsen bath experience and savor authentic kaiseki breakfast overlooking the city skyline.', 'A valid government-issued ID is required at check-in, and a refundable security deposit of ¥10,000 is collected upon arrival. Quiet hours are observed from 10 PM to 8 AM; guests are kindly requested to keep noise levels minimal during these times.', 35.660556, 139.704166, 21, 'Sakura Whisper Boutique - Shibuya', false, 4, 8, 16),
(48, 'Higashiyama Ward, Gion-machi, Kitagawa 120, Kyoto', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', false, true, 'Experience the perfect blend of traditional Japanese hospitality and contemporary comfort in the heart of Kyoto''s most enchanting geisha district. This intimate hotel captures the essence of historic Gion with its elegant wooden architecture and serene garden courtyards, while offering modern amenities and personalized service. Wake to the whisper of traditional performances echoing through centuries-old wooden machiya buildings and immerse yourself in authentic Kyoto culture.', 'A refundable deposit of ¥10,000 is required at check-in (credit card or cash accepted). Quiet hours are strictly observed from 10 PM to 8 AM; guests must present a valid ID or passport at registration, and smoking is prohibited in all guest rooms.', 35.004181, 135.777871, 18, 'Gion Moonlight Ryokan & Modern Hotel', true, 3, 1, 21),
(49, '42 Rue Lepic, 75018 Paris, France', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Step into the romantic heart of Paris at our charming guesthouse nestled in the enchanting streets of Montmartre. Wake up surrounded by artistic heritage, with the iconic Sacré-Cœur basilica just steps away and the vibrant atmosphere of Place du Tertre at your doorstep. Experience authentic Parisian living in our carefully restored 19th-century building, where Belle Époque charm meets modern comfort.', 'A €150 security deposit is required upon arrival and will be fully refunded after checkout, provided no damages occur. Guest ID (passport or national ID) is mandatory for all bookings, and we kindly request quiet hours from 10 PM to 8 AM to maintain a peaceful environment for all guests.', 48.886153, 2.334613, 21, 'Le Ciel de Montmartre Guesthouse', false, 4, 6, 13),
(50, '1523 Ocean Drive, Miami, FL 33139', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Wake up to the vibrant energy of Miami right in the heart of the action! Our trendy hostel puts you steps away from South Beach, world-class dining, and the city''s hottest nightlife, all while keeping your wallet happy. Experience the perfect blend of comfort, community, and endless sunshine in South Florida''s most exciting destination.', 'All guests must present a valid government-issued ID at check-in; a refundable security deposit of $50 applies to all bookings. Quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM—please respect shared spaces and keep noise to a minimum during these times.', 25.786817, -80.128932, 18, 'Ocean Breeze Miami Backpackers', false, 4, 5, 7),
(51, '2-18-9 Shibuya, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience the vibrant pulse of Tokyo from our modern hostel in the heart of Shibuya! Perfect for budget-conscious travelers seeking authentic connections, we offer clean dormitory beds, free high-speed WiFi, and a buzzing communal lounge where guests from around the world gather to swap travel stories. Our prime location puts you steps away from iconic neighborhoods, temples, and the famous Shibuya Crossing.', 'A valid government-issued ID is required for check-in, and we require a ¥5,000 refundable deposit. Quiet hours are enforced from 11:00 PM to 8:00 AM in all shared dormitory areas.', 35.659464, 139.704460, 18, 'Neon Dreams Tokyo Hostel', false, 4, 5, 16),
(52, '42 Campbell Parade, Bondi Beach NSW 2026', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the vibrant charm of Sydney''s most iconic beachside suburb at our stylish boutique hotel, just steps from the golden sands of Bondi Beach. Our intimate, design-forward accommodations blend contemporary elegance with local coastal character, featuring ocean-inspired décor and personalized service. Wake up to the sound of waves and explore world-class dining, trendy cafés, and pristine coastal walks right at your doorstep.', 'A non-refundable deposit of 30% is required at booking, with final payment due 7 days before arrival. Please note that quiet hours are enforced between 10 PM and 8 AM; a valid government-issued ID is required at check-in.', -33.893294, 151.272987, 18, 'Bondi Breeze Boutique Hotel', false, 4, 8, 40),
(53, '1425 Collins Avenue, South Beach, Miami, FL 33139', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the vibrant pulse of South Beach at our intimate 45-room boutique hotel, where art deco charm meets contemporary luxury. Our rooftop pool overlooks the ocean, curated restaurant serves farm-to-table cuisine, and each room features custom-designed interiors and premium amenities. Wake up to the sound of waves and end your evenings sipping cocktails with Miami''s most discerning travelers.', 'A non-refundable deposit of 25% is required at booking, with final payment due 7 days prior to arrival. Valid government ID and credit card are required at check-in; guests under 21 are not permitted, and quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM.', 25.786184, -80.130493, 21, 'Tropicale Glamour Boutique Hotel', false, 4, 8, 8),
(54, 'Hanami-cho 247, Higashiyama Ward, Kyoto', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the enchanting heart of Kyoto''s most iconic district from our beautifully restored traditional guesthouse. Nestled among atmospheric wooden machiya townhouses and lantern-lit streets, our intimate guesthouse offers authentic cultural immersion steps away from historic temples and the famous Gion Corner. Wake to the whisper of morning bells and the charm of geisha district living.', 'A 5,000 JPY deposit is required upon check-in and will be refunded after departure inspection. Quiet hours are observed from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM; a valid government-issued ID is required for all guests at registration.', 34.992610, 135.774863, 18, 'Gion Geisha House Retreat', false, 5, 6, 21),
(55, 'Passeig de Gràcia 92, Barcelona', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Escape to your own slice of Catalan luxury perched in the heart of Barcelona with stunning views of the city and Mediterranean coastline. This five-star resort combines modernist elegance with contemporary comfort, featuring world-class amenities, Michelin-inspired dining, and exclusive access to Barcelona''s most vibrant neighborhoods. Immerse yourself in Gaudí-inspired architecture and unwind in our award-winning spa while experiencing the magic of Barcelona''s artistic soul.', 'A refundable security deposit of €300 is required upon check-in, and valid government-issued ID is mandatory for all guests. Quiet hours are observed from 10 PM to 8 AM—please be mindful of fellow guests during these times.', 41.395184, 2.161774, 18, 'Park Güell Paradise Resort & Spa', true, 4, 4, 31),
(56, 'Shinjuku-ku Kabukicho 1-15-10, Tokyo', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the vibrant energy of Tokyo''s most iconic district from this sleek, contemporary apartment just steps away from Shinjuku Station. This stylishly designed 1-bedroom retreat features modern furnishings, a fully equipped kitchenette, and stunning city views that showcase the dazzling neon-lit streets below. Perfect for business travelers and tourists seeking an authentic yet comfortable base in the bustling heart of Shinjuku.', 'A refundable deposit of ¥30,000 is required upon check-in, and guests must present a valid passport or ID at arrival. Please note that quiet hours are strictly enforced from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM to ensure peaceful accommodation for all residents.', 35.694147, 139.702376, 21, 'Neon Dreams Shinjuku Studio - Modern Living in Tokyo''s Heart', false, 3, 2, 17),
(57, '347 Soi Charoen Nakhon 53, Charoen Nakhon Road, Bang Kho Laem, Bangkok, Thailand', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the vibrant energy of Bangkok from our stunning riverside boutique hotel perched along the iconic Chao Phraya River. Our elegantly appointed suites blend contemporary Thai design with modern luxury, offering world-class amenities including a rooftop infinity pool, spa, and award-winning restaurant. Discover the perfect balance of cultural immersion and sophisticated comfort in the heart of Thailand''s enchanting capital.', 'A valid passport or government-issued ID is required for all check-ins, and a refundable security deposit of 2,000 THB is payable upon arrival. Quiet hours are observed from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM to ensure all guests enjoy a peaceful stay.', 13.709807, 100.498855, 21, 'Chakra Bangkok Riverside Luxury', false, 4, 1, 35),
(58, '245 East 24th Street, Manhattan, New York, NY 10010', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience the vibrant energy of New York City from our prime Manhattan location, surrounded by trendy shops, world-class restaurants, and iconic attractions. Our modern hostel combines affordability with comfort, featuring stylish dorms, a lively common area, and 24-hour access to help you make the most of your NYC adventure. Whether you''re a solo traveler, backpacker, or group looking to connect with fellow explorers, Urban Pulse is your perfect home base in the heart of the city.', 'Valid government-issued ID required at check-in; guests must be 18 years or older. Quiet hours are enforced from 11 PM to 8 AM—please be respectful of other guests'' sleep schedules. A refundable $25 security deposit is required upon arrival.', 40.738801, -73.980532, 21, 'Urban Pulse Manhattan Hostel', false, 3, 5, 4),
(59, 'Sukhumvit Road 101, Sukhumvit, Bangkok', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the vibrant energy of Bangkok''s most dynamic neighborhood at Sukhumvit Nomad House, where budget-conscious travelers connect with fellow adventurers in our meticulously designed dormitories and private rooms. Nestled just steps away from world-class street food, trendy bars, and the iconic Sukhumvit entertainment scene, our hostel combines comfort, affordability, and an unbeatable social atmosphere. Whether you''re backpacking Southeast Asia or exploring the City of Angels, we offer the perfect base for unforgettable Bangkok memories.', 'A valid photo ID is required at check-in, and we request a THB 1,000 security deposit for room keys (fully refundable). Please note our quiet hours are from 10 PM to 8 AM—we ask all guests to be considerate of fellow travelers during these times.', 13.685645, 100.611386, 18, 'Sukhumvit Nomad House', true, 3, 5, 36),
(60, '132 Sueyoshicho, Shimogyo Ward, Kyoto 600-8212', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Wake up steps away from Kyoto''s enchanting geisha district! Our beautifully restored traditional machiya-style hostel blends authentic Japanese charm with modern traveler comforts, offering the perfect base to explore ancient temples, bamboo groves, and vibrant local markets. Connect with fellow adventurers in our common spaces while enjoying complimentary tea ceremonies and cultural workshops.', 'A valid government-issued photo ID is required at check-in, and a ¥3,000 refundable damage deposit is due upon arrival. Please note our quiet hours are from 10 PM to 9 AM—we''re committed to ensuring all guests enjoy a peaceful night''s rest.', 35.004991, 135.773871, 18, 'Geisha District Gate Hostel', true, 4, 5, 20),
(61, '142 Bedford Avenue, Brooklyn, New York', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience authentic Brooklyn charm at our intimate 24-room boutique hotel nestled in the heart of Williamsburg. Our carefully curated property features locally-sourced amenities, rooftop city views, and a vibrant ground-floor café that captures the neighborhood''s creative spirit. From our doorstep, explore world-class street art, trendy galleries, and the best independent restaurants in New York City.', 'A valid government-issued ID is required at check-in, and a refundable deposit of $50 is collected upon arrival. Please note that quiet hours are enforced between 10 PM and 8 AM to ensure a peaceful stay for all guests.', 40.719174, -73.956562, 18, 'The Williamsburg Gem - Boutique Hotel', false, 4, 8, 5),
(62, '2-15-10 Shinjuku, Shinjuku-ku, Tokyo', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Immerse yourself in Tokyo''s electric energy at our stylish boutique hotel in the heart of Shinjuku, where minimalist Japanese design meets contemporary luxury. Just steps from the vibrant streets, izakayas, and iconic neon-lit entertainment district, our intimate property offers personalized service and curated local experiences. Wake up to the pulse of Tokyo and retreat to your serene sanctuary at the end of each unforgettable day.', 'A government-issued ID is required at check-in for all guests. Please note that a refundable security deposit of ¥10,000 is collected upon arrival, and quiet hours are observed between 10:00 PM and 8:00 AM.', 35.690985, 139.708915, 21, 'Neon Dreams Shinjuku - A Boutique Stay', true, 2, 8, 17),
(63, 'Calle del Traghetto, 1847', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Wake up to the gentle lapping of Venetian canal waters at this stunning waterfront villa, featuring original Renaissance architecture with modern luxury amenities. This exclusive property offers direct gondola dock access and panoramic views of the Grand Canal, providing an unforgettable escape in the heart of Venice. Immerse yourself in authentic Italian elegance while enjoying contemporary comfort and personalized service.', 'A refundable security deposit of €500 is required upon arrival, and valid government-issued ID is mandatory for all guests. Please note that quiet hours are observed between 10 PM and 8 AM to respect neighboring properties.', 45.442684, 12.331155, 21, 'La Serenità Veneziana - Waterfront Paradise', false, 3, 3, 27),
(64, 'Calle Larga San Marco, 412', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the magic of Venice in this exquisite waterfront resort nestled along the Grand Canal. Our elegant palazzo combines authentic Venetian charm with modern luxury, offering stunning canal views, world-class dining, and direct access to the city''s most iconic landmarks. Immerse yourself in centuries of history while enjoying five-star amenities and personalized service that will make your Italian getaway unforgettable.', 'A 20% deposit is required to confirm your reservation, with full payment due 30 days prior to arrival. All guests must present a valid government-issued ID and passport at check-in, and we respectfully enforce quiet hours between 10 PM and 8 AM to maintain the tranquility of our property.', 45.435316, 12.339825, 21, 'Palazzo Serenità Venezia', false, 5, 4, 27),
(65, '245 Kent Avenue, Brooklyn, New York 11211', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience contemporary elegance in this stunning Brooklyn villa featuring floor-to-ceiling windows with Manhattan skyline views. This sophisticated retreat boasts a private outdoor terrace, chef''s kitchen, and upscale finishes throughout, perfectly positioned in the heart of vibrant Williamsburg. Immerse yourself in Brooklyn''s world-class dining, art galleries, and cultural scene while enjoying the serenity of your private urban oasis.', 'A refundable security deposit of $500 is required upon booking, and a valid government-issued ID must be presented at check-in. Quiet hours are from 10 PM to 8 AM daily to ensure a peaceful environment for all guests.', 40.716386, -73.965727, 18, 'Williamsburg Waterfront Villa - Modern Luxury Retreat', false, 4, 3, 5),
(66, '285 Kent Avenue, Brooklyn, New York 11211', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience luxury overlooking the East River at Brooklyn''s most sophisticated retreat. Our boutique resort features modern suites with floor-to-ceiling windows, a full-service spa, and award-winning farm-to-table dining. Discover the perfect blend of urban energy and peaceful waterfront escape in the heart of Williamsburg.', 'A non-refundable security deposit of $150 is required at check-in; valid government-issued ID is mandatory for all guests. Quiet hours are observed from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM daily.', 40.715149, -73.966420, 21, 'The Williamsburg Waterfront Resort & Spa', false, 3, 4, 5),
(67, 'Via della Lungaretta 45, Trastevere, Rome', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', false, true, 'Wake up in the heart of Rome''s most charming neighborhood! Our vibrant hostel puts you steps away from cobblestone streets, authentic trattorias, and the iconic Tiber River. Whether you''re backpacking Europe or meeting fellow travelers, La Dolce Vita Hostel offers the perfect blend of comfort, community, and classic Roman romance.', 'A €25 refundable deposit is required upon check-in for room keys and damage liability. Please note quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM—a valid ID or passport is required for all guests at registration.', 41.889477, 12.474050, 18, 'La Dolce Vita Hostel Trastevere', true, 4, 5, 25),
(68, '45 Rue des Francs Bourgeois, 75003 Paris', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Step into Parisian luxury in this stunning villa nestled in the heart of Le Marais, one of Paris''s most vibrant and historic neighborhoods. With its charming façade, elegant interiors, and access to world-class galleries, boutiques, and restaurants, this is your perfect base for experiencing authentic Parisian living. Wake up to the artistic energy of the district while enjoying the comfort and privacy of your own exclusive retreat.', 'A security deposit of €500 is required at check-in, and guests must present a valid government ID upon arrival. Please note that quiet hours are observed from 10 PM to 9 AM to respect our neighbors in this residential area.', 48.858229, 2.359435, 21, 'Maison Elegante Le Marais', false, 3, 3, 12),
(69, '42 Rue Lepic, 75018 Paris', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Wake up to stunning views of the Sacré-Cœur Basilica from this charming guesthouse nestled in the heart of Paris''s most artistic neighborhood. Our intimate boutique property blends Parisian elegance with authentic bohemian charm, offering guests a perfect base to explore winding cobblestone streets, local cafés, and world-class museums. Experience the magic of Montmartre with personalized hospitality and thoughtfully designed rooms that capture the spirit of Belle Époque Paris.', 'A valid government-issued ID is required for check-in, and a security deposit of €150 is charged upon arrival (fully refundable). Please note that quiet hours are observed from 10 PM to 8 AM—we ask all guests to respect our peaceful atmosphere during these times.', 48.886153, 2.334613, 18, 'Bohemian Retreat Montmartre', true, 5, 6, 13),
(70, '305 Fifth Avenue, New York, New York 10016', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience timeless elegance in the heart of New York City at The Velvet Manhattan, where sophisticated design meets personalized service. Our intimate 47-room boutique hotel captures the essence of Manhattan''s golden age while offering contemporary amenities and curated art collections. Ideal for discerning travelers seeking an exclusive urban retreat away from the ordinary.', 'A valid photo ID is required at check-in, and a refundable security deposit of $150 USD is required upon arrival. Please note that quiet hours are enforced from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM daily to ensure a peaceful environment for all our guests.', 40.746612, -73.985553, 21, 'The Velvet Manhattan - Luxury Boutique Hotel', false, 4, 8, 3),
(71, '245 Bedford Avenue, Brooklyn, New York 11211', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the vibrant heart of Brooklyn at The Brooklyn Wanderer, your gateway to iconic neighborhoods, world-class dining, and thriving arts scenes. Our stylish, social hostel features cozy dormitory rooms, private suites, and a rooftop lounge perfect for meeting fellow travelers. Located just steps from the L train and surrounded by independent shops, galleries, and cafes, we''re your perfect home base for exploring New York City.', 'A valid government-issued ID is required for check-in, and guests must be at least 18 years old. Quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM; a $100 security deposit is required and will be refunded upon checkout assuming no damages.', 40.715771, -73.959796, 21, 'The Brooklyn Wanderer Hostel', false, 2, 5, 5),
(72, '245 Lexington Avenue, New York, New York, United States', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Discover urban elegance at The Velvet Lexington, a sophisticated boutique hotel nestled in the heart of Manhattan where contemporary design meets timeless New York charm. Each thoughtfully curated room features custom furnishings, premium linens, and curated local artwork, creating an intimate retreat steps from world-class dining and iconic attractions. Experience personalized service and exclusive access to our rooftop bar overlooking the Manhattan skyline.', 'A valid government-issued ID and credit card are required at check-in. Please note that a 20% non-refundable deposit is required to secure your reservation, with quiet hours observed daily from 10 PM to 8 AM.', 40.746644, -73.979208, 18, 'The Velvet Lexington', false, 4, 8, 3),
(73, '342 Prospect Park West, Brooklyn, New York', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Step into rustic charm in the heart of New York City with this delightful cottage nestled in a quiet Brooklyn neighborhood. Featuring exposed brick walls, hardwood floors, and a charming garden, this intimate retreat offers the perfect escape from the bustling Manhattan streets. Wake up to artisanal coffee shops and farm-to-table restaurants just around the corner, while your own private sanctuary awaits when you return.', 'A security deposit of $250 is required upon booking and will be returned within 7 days of checkout, provided the property is in good condition. Please note that quiet hours are enforced from 10 PM to 8 AM, and valid photo ID is required for all guests at check-in.', 40.656610, -73.984020, 21, 'The Cozy Brooklyn Hideaway', false, 4, 7, 3),
(74, 'Cannaregio 3852, Calle dei Tre Archi', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Step into timeless elegance at our stunning waterfront palazzo nestled in the heart of Venice''s most enchanting neighborhood. This lovingly restored 15th-century palace combines authentic Venetian grandeur with modern comfort, offering breathtaking views of the Grand Canal from every room. Experience the magic of Venice like a true local while indulging in world-class hospitality and exquisite Italian charm.', 'A valid photo ID and credit card are required at check-in, and we request a refundable security deposit of €150 upon arrival. Please note that quiet hours are observed from 10 PM to 8 AM daily to ensure all guests enjoy a peaceful stay.', 45.445569, 12.320734, 18, 'Ca'' d''Oro Palace - Venetian Dreams', true, 5, 1, 27),
(75, 'Calle del Forno 42, Venice 30100', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Wake up to the gentle lapping of Venetian waters in this charming cottage nestled in the heart of Venice''s most picturesque neighborhoods. This authentic property offers a perfect blend of historic Venetian character and modern comfort, with direct access to iconic canals and hidden local piazzas. Your personal slice of la dolce vita awaits just steps away from world-famous landmarks and hidden trattorias.', 'A €200 security deposit is required at check-in and will be returned upon departure pending inspection. Guests are required to maintain quiet hours between 10 PM and 8 AM, and a valid government ID must be presented upon arrival for registration purposes.', 45.436434, 12.323707, 21, 'Venetian Dream Cottage - Canal View Retreat', false, 4, 7, 27),
(76, 'Carrer de la Boqueria 46, Barcelona', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience the vibrant heart of Barcelona at our iconic hostel steps from the famous La Rambla. With stylish dorms, a lively rooftop bar, and a perfect location for exploring Gothic architecture and Mediterranean beaches, we''re your gateway to unforgettable adventures. Meet fellow travelers while enjoying complimentary walking tours and local tapas nights.', 'A €50 deposit (cash or card) is required at check-in and will be refunded upon departure; valid ID is mandatory for all guests. Quiet hours are enforced from 11 PM to 8 AM in dormitory areas.', 41.381723, 2.175548, 18, 'La Rambla Wanderers Hostel', false, 3, 5, 31),
(77, '42 Rue de Fleurus, 75006 Paris', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, false, 'Experience timeless Parisian charm in this beautifully restored belle époque villa nestled in the heart of the Left Bank. This luxurious retreat features classic French architecture, sunlit rooms with original parquet floors, and a private garden courtyard—your perfect escape in the City of Light. Wake up to café au lait and croissants while admiring views of charming Parisian rooftops from your private terrace.', 'A refundable security deposit of €500 is required at check-in. Please note that quiet hours are from 10 PM to 8 AM, and a valid government-issued ID is required for all guests at arrival. Key pickup is available 24/7 from the concierge desk.', 48.846642, 2.327791, 18, 'Lumière de Paris - Elegant Left Bank Villa', false, 2, 3, 11),
(78, '42 Campbell Parade, Bondi Beach NSW 2026', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Wake up to the sound of crashing waves at our charming beachfront guesthouse, just steps away from iconic Bondi Beach. Our stylish rooms feature ocean views, modern amenities, and a welcoming atmosphere perfect for both solo travelers and groups. Experience the vibrant Bondi lifestyle with easy access to world-class beaches, trendy cafes, and coastal walks right at your doorstep.', 'A $150 AUD refundable security deposit is required upon check-in, and guests must present valid ID. Please note that quiet hours are strictly observed between 10 PM and 8 AM to respect all guests'' rest.', -33.893294, 151.272987, 18, 'Bondi Beach Bliss Guesthouse', false, 4, 6, 40),
(79, '247 Spring Street, Manhattan, New York 10012', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', true, true, 'Experience the pulse of New York City from our intimate, design-forward boutique hotel nestled in the heart of SoHo. Each of our meticulously curated suites combines contemporary art installations with vintage furnishings, offering guests a gallery-like sanctuary steps away from world-class dining and shopping. Wake up to the energy of Manhattan''s most vibrant neighborhood and immerse yourself in authentic urban luxury.', 'A valid government-issued photo ID is required at check-in for all guests; we also require a refundable security deposit of $200. Please note our quiet hours are enforced between 10 PM and 8 AM to ensure all guests enjoy a peaceful stay.', 40.725632, -74.005255, 21, 'The Velvet Canvas - A Manhattan Boutique Escape', true, 5, 8, 4),
(80, '45 Willow Street, Brooklyn, New York', '22:00:00', '14:00:00', '11:00:00', false, false, 'Escape the hustle of Manhattan and unwind in this charming cottage nestled in the heart of Brooklyn Heights, offering a perfect blend of historic character and modern comfort. This intimate retreat features exposed brick walls, vintage furnishings, and a private garden sanctuary—your perfect home base for exploring New York City. Wake up to stunning skyline views and fall asleep to the peaceful ambiance of tree-lined streets.', 'A $500 refundable security deposit is required upon booking, and guests must provide a valid government-issued ID at check-in. Please note that quiet hours are enforced between 10 PM and 8 AM to ensure a peaceful environment for all guests.', 40.699807, -73.994487, 18, 'The Cozy Brooklyn Heights Hideaway', false, 3, 7, 3);
