(208, 'Check-in is available from 3:00 PM and check-out is at 11:00 AM. If you need early check-in or late check-out, please contact us in advance and we''ll do our best to accommodate your request based on availability. Early check-in may be available for an additional fee.', 'What are your check-in and check-out times?', 70),
(209, 'Yes, free on-site parking is included with your stay. We offer one complimentary parking space per room. Additional spaces are available for $15 per night. Street parking is also available in the surrounding area. Please note that large vehicles may require prior arrangement.', 'Is parking available at the property?', 70),
(210, 'We offer a flexible cancellation policy with free cancellations up to 7 days before your arrival date. Cancellations made within 7 days of check-in are subject to a one-night charge. In case of emergency, please contact our management team to discuss options. Refunds are typically processed within 5-7 business days.', 'What is your cancellation policy?', 70),
(211, 'Check-in is available from 3:00 PM onwards, and check-out is at 11:00 AM. If you need an early check-in or late check-out, please contact us in advance and we''ll do our best to accommodate your request based on availability.', 'What is the check-in and check-out time?', 71),
(212, 'Yes, we offer complimentary on-site parking for all guests. Parking is included in your room rate at no extra charge. We have designated spaces available on a first-come, first-served basis. If you have a large vehicle, please inform us upon booking so we can reserve an appropriate space.', 'Is parking available, and are there any additional fees?', 71),
(213, 'We welcome well-behaved pets at our property for a non-refundable pet fee of $25 per pet, per stay. Pets must be kept on a leash in common areas and should not be left unattended in the room. Please inform us about your pet when making your reservation so we can prepare accordingly.', 'Are pets allowed at the property?', 71),
(214, 'Check-in is available from 3:00 PM onwards, and check-out is at 11:00 AM. Early check-in or late check-out may be available upon request, subject to availability and an additional fee of $50 per hour.', 'What is your check-in and check-out time?', 72),
(215, 'Yes, complimentary parking is included for all guests. We provide one free parking spot per room. Additional spots can be arranged for $15 per night on a first-come, first-served basis. Covered parking options are also available upon request.', 'Is parking included, and is it free?', 72),
(216, 'Our standard cancellation policy allows free cancellation up to 7 days before arrival. Cancellations made 3-7 days before arrival will incur a 50% fee, and cancellations within 3 days are non-refundable. Regarding pets, we are pet-friendly and welcome dogs and cats for a one-time pet fee of $25. Emotional support animals stay free with proper documentation.', 'What is your cancellation policy, and are pets allowed?', 72),
(217, 'Check-in is available from 3:00 PM and check-out is at 11:00 AM. Early check-in or late check-out may be available upon request for an additional fee, depending on availability. Please contact the property in advance to arrange this.', 'What are the check-in and check-out times?', 73),
(218, 'Yes, free on-site parking is included with your stay. We offer both covered and uncovered parking spaces. There is no additional charge, and parking is available on a first-come, first-served basis. Each unit is typically allocated one dedicated spot.', 'Is parking available and are there any additional fees?', 73),
(219, 'Cancellations made 14 days or more before the check-in date will receive a full refund. Cancellations made 7-13 days before check-in will be charged 50% of the booking amount. Cancellations within 7 days of check-in are non-refundable. We recommend purchasing travel insurance for added protection.', 'What is your cancellation policy?', 73),
(220, 'Check-in is available from 3:00 PM, and check-out is at 11:00 AM. Early check-in or late check-out may be available depending on availability. Please contact us at least 24 hours in advance to request these options, and additional fees may apply.', 'What are the check-in and check-out times?', 74),
(221, 'Yes, complimentary parking is included with your stay. We offer both covered parking in our garage and outdoor parking spaces on a first-come, first-served basis. No additional parking fees apply, and all guests receive one free parking pass.', 'Is parking included, and are there any additional fees?', 74),
(222, 'Cancellations made up to 14 days before your arrival date will receive a full refund. Cancellations made between 7-14 days prior will incur a 50% fee. Cancellations within 7 days of arrival or no-shows are non-refundable. Special events and holiday bookings may have different terms—please review your confirmation for details.', 'What is your cancellation policy?', 74),
(223, 'Check-in is available from 3:00 PM and check-out is at 11:00 AM. Early check-in and late check-out may be available upon request, subject to availability and an additional fee. Please contact the property in advance if you need to arrange these accommodations.', 'What time is check-in and check-out?', 75),
(224, 'Yes, we offer complimentary parking for all guests. One designated parking space is included with each booking. Additional parking spots are available for an extra charge of $15 per night if needed. Please note that oversized vehicles may require special arrangements.', 'Is there free parking available at the property?', 75),
(225, 'A full continental breakfast is included complimentary with all bookings and is served daily from 7:00 AM to 10:00 AM in the dining area. Our cancellation policy allows free cancellation up to 7 days before your arrival date. Cancellations made within 7 days of arrival will be charged at 50% of the booking rate, and cancellations within 48 hours will forfeit the entire reservation.', 'Is breakfast included, and what is the cancellation policy?', 75),
(226, 'Check-in begins at 3:00 PM and check-out is at 11:00 AM. If you need early check-in or late check-out, please contact us in advance and we''ll do our best to accommodate your request subject to availability. Early check-in may be available for an additional fee.', 'What time is check-in and check-out?', 76),
(227, 'Yes, complimentary parking is included with your stay. We offer both covered and uncovered parking spaces on a first-come, first-served basis. One parking space per room is included; additional spaces are available for $15 per night if needed.', 'Is parking available and are there any additional fees?', 76),
(228, 'Cancellations made 7 days or more before your arrival date will receive a full refund. Cancellations made 3-6 days before arrival will be charged 50% of the booking price. Cancellations within 72 hours of arrival are non-refundable. In case of emergency, please contact us directly to discuss options.', 'What is your cancellation policy?', 76),
(229, 'We offer flexible cancellation for most reservations made 7 or more days before your arrival date. Cancellations made 7 days or later are subject to a one-night charge. Reservations cancelled within 24 hours of arrival are non-refundable. For special events or holiday bookings, different terms may apply. Please contact us directly for more information about your specific reservation.', 'What is your cancellation policy?', 77),
(230, 'Yes, complimentary parking is available for all guests. We offer both covered and uncovered parking spaces on a first-come, first-served basis. If you have a large vehicle or require reserved parking, please notify us at least 48 hours before arrival. Oversized vehicles may incur an additional $15 per night fee.', 'Is parking available, and are there any additional fees?', 77),
(231, 'We welcome pets at our property! Dogs and cats are allowed for a non-refundable pet fee of $25 per stay. Pets must be housetrained and well-behaved. We ask that pets are not left unattended for extended periods and that you inform us of your pet upon booking. Assistance animals are always welcome at no additional charge. Please review our full pet policy for any size or breed restrictions.', 'Are pets allowed, and what are the pet policies?', 77),
(232, 'Standard check-in is at 3:00 PM and check-out is at 11:00 AM. Early check-in may be available upon request if the room is ready (subject to a $25 fee for check-in before 12:00 PM). Late check-out can be arranged until 2:00 PM at no extra charge based on availability, or until 6:00 PM for $50. We recommend contacting the property at least 24 hours in advance to confirm.', 'What time is check-in and check-out, and is early check-in or late check-out available?', 78),
(233, 'A complimentary continental breakfast is included for all guests and features fresh pastries, cereals, yogurt, fruit, coffee, tea, and juice. Breakfast is served daily from 7:00 AM to 10:00 AM in the dining area. Hot breakfast items are available for an additional charge. Special dietary requirements can be accommodated with 48 hours'' notice.', 'Is breakfast included with my stay, and what are the breakfast hours?', 78),
(234, 'Our flexible cancellation policy allows free cancellation up to 7 days before arrival. Cancellations within 7 days will be charged one night''s stay. For stays longer than 30 days, different terms apply. Regarding pets: we welcome well-behaved dogs and cats (up to 2 pets) for a non-refundable pet fee of $30 per night. Pets must be housetrained and cannot be left unattended in rooms. Please inform us of your pet when booking.', 'What is your cancellation policy and are pets allowed at the property?', 78),
(235, 'Check-in is available from 3:00 PM and check-out is at 11:00 AM. Early check-in may be available upon request depending on availability, and late check-out can be arranged for an additional fee of $25 per hour or $75 for a full day extension.', 'What time is check-in and check-out?', 79),
(236, 'Yes, parking is included free of charge for all guests. We offer complimentary on-site parking with dedicated spaces. If you''re arriving in multiple vehicles, please notify us in advance so we can reserve additional spaces for you.', 'Is parking included and is it free?', 79),
(237, 'We offer flexible cancellation up to 7 days before your arrival for a full refund. Cancellations made within 7 days of check-in will be charged 50% of the booking total. Cancellations within 48 hours are non-refundable. We recommend purchasing travel insurance for added peace of mind.', 'What is your cancellation policy?', 79),
(238, 'Check-in is available from 3:00 PM onwards on your arrival date. Check-out is at 11:00 AM on your departure date. Early check-in and late check-out may be available upon request at an additional cost, subject to availability. Please contact us in advance to arrange these accommodations.', 'What time is check-in and check-out?', 80),
(239, 'Yes, complimentary parking is included with your stay. We offer both covered and open parking spaces in our secure lot. Each room receives one parking pass; additional vehicles may park for a fee of $15 per day. Overnight street parking is not permitted. Please provide your vehicle details upon check-in.', 'Is parking available and is there an additional fee?', 80),
(240, 'Our standard cancellation policy allows free cancellations up to 7 days before your arrival date. Cancellations within 7 days of check-in are subject to a one-night charge. We are a pet-friendly property and welcome one well-behaved pet per room for a $25 per night fee. Pets must be crated when unattended and prior notice is required at the time of booking.', 'What is your cancellation policy and are pets allowed?', 80);
